{
  "tema": 5061,
  "slug": "ojala-subjuntivo",
  "titulo": "Using ojalá + the present subjunctive to express hope",
  "subtitulo": "¡Ojalá haya olas!: a strong I hope, always with the subjunctive.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Ojalá (or ojalá que) + present subjunctive = I hope, hopefully, about the future. Never the indicative. It's stronger than espero que.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ojalá** is a very common word meaning _I hope, hopefully, let's hope_. Followed by the **present subjunctive**, it expresses a hope about the **future**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**ojalá** (**que**)",
            "present subjunctive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It's **always** followed by the subjunctive, never by the indicative. **Que** is optional: **ojalá llueva** = **ojalá que llueva**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It doesn't change for the person: the subject is in the verb after it."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It comes from Arabic and originally meant _God willing_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "You can say the same with **espero que** + subjunctive, but **ojalá** sounds more intense."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ojalá** is crossing your fingers out loud."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Mi mamá dice que ojalá me ==case== pronto.",
              "en": "My mom says she hopes I get married soon."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ojalá ==tengas== suerte en el torneo.",
              "en": "I hope you're lucky in the tournament."
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Ojalá no ==llueva== mañana!",
              "en": "I hope it doesn't rain tomorrow!"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Ojalá que Beto me ==llame== pronto!",
              "en": "I hope Beto calls me soon!"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Ojalá que nos ==contraten== a todos!",
              "en": "I hope they hire all of us!"
            },
            {
              "es": "¡Ojalá ==haya== olas el sábado!",
              "en": "Hopefully there'll be waves on Saturday!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
